pybot-rs
=========

This crate is a partial Rust port of PyBot
(https://github.com/huggingface/pybot), copyright its authors
(Hugging Face), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Reply pools, matching patterns and the runtime architecture in
`src/runtime.rs` and `src/modules/` are adapted from the upstream
Python source. The upstream LICENSE applies to those portions and a
copy is kept in this repository. This port is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Hugging Face.
